{"id":"u52","kelas":"kerja","no":5,"judul":"Telepon dan Pesan Suara","title":"Phone Calls and Voicemail","emoji":"📞","ringkas":"Menerima, menyambungkan, mengeja, dan meninggalkan pesan","ready":true,"goals":["menjawab telepon kantor dengan sopan dan jelas","menanyakan identitas penelepon dan menyambungkan telepon: [[Who's calling, please?]], [[I'll put you through.]]","mencatat dan menyampaikan pesan: [[Can I take a message?]]","mengeja nama, email, dan nomor telepon dengan jelas","meminta pengulangan dan klarifikasi dengan sopan","meninggalkan **voicemail** yang singkat dan lengkap"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di telepon kita tidak bisa melihat wajah atau gerak tubuh, jadi **kejelasan** dan **kesopanan** sangat penting. Unit ini memberimu kalimat siap pakai untuk menjawab, menyambungkan, mencatat pesan, dan meninggalkan voicemail."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Menjawab dan menelepon","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan","Contoh"],["Menjawab","[[Good morning, ... speaking. How can I help you?]]","[[Good morning, PT Maju Jaya, Dina speaking. How can I help you?]]"],["Menelepon","[[Hello, this is ... from ...]]","[[Hello, this is Tom from Sales.]]"],["Meminta orang","[[Could I speak to ..., please?]]","[[Could I speak to Mr. Adi, please?]]"],["Menanyakan identitas","[[May I ask who's calling?]] / [[Who's calling, please?]]","[[May I ask who's calling?]]"],["Menyambungkan","[[I'll put you through.]] / [[Hold the line, please.]]","[[One moment, I'll put you through.]]"],["Menyebut tujuan","[[I'm calling about / to ...]]","[[I'm calling to confirm our meeting.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Speaking, bukan I am","text":"Dalam telepon, kita berkata [[This is Dina]] atau [[Dina speaking]], bukan *I am Dina*. Untuk menanyakan: [[Who's calling?]], bukan *Who are you?*."},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Situasi yang sering terjadi","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan"],["Orang tidak ada","[[I'm afraid he's not in at the moment.]] / [[He's out of the office.]]"],["Sedang rapat","[[She's in a meeting right now.]] / [[She's on another call.]]"],["Menawarkan pesan","[[Can I take a message?]] / [[Would you like to leave a message?]]"],["Menelepon balik","[[I'll ask him to call you back.]] / [[Could you call me back?]]"],["Menyuruh menunggu","[[Could you hold, please?]] / [[Just a moment, please.]]"],["Salah sambung","[[I think you have the wrong number.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"hold the line","id":"tunggu di telepon","ex":"Please hold the line."},{"en":"put through","id":"menyambungkan","ex":"I'll put you through to Sales."},{"en":"extension","id":"nomor sambungan","ex":"Please dial extension 205."},{"en":"message","id":"pesan","ex":"Can I take a message?"},{"en":"voicemail","id":"pesan suara","ex":"Please leave a voicemail."},{"en":"call back","id":"menelepon balik","ex":"I'll call you back later."},{"en":"get through","id":"berhasil tersambung","ex":"I couldn't get through to him."},{"en":"busy","id":"sibuk / terpakai","ex":"The line is busy."},{"en":"signal","id":"sinyal","ex":"The signal is weak."},{"en":"speak up","id":"bicara lebih keras","ex":"Could you speak up, please?"},{"en":"repeat","id":"mengulang","ex":"Could you repeat that, please?"},{"en":"spell","id":"mengeja","ex":"Could you spell your name?"},{"en":"landline","id":"telepon rumah/kantor","ex":"Call me on the landline."},{"en":"area code","id":"kode area","ex":"The area code is 022."},{"en":"hang up","id":"menutup telepon","ex":"Don't hang up."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Meminta pengulangan dan klarifikasi","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Tidak dengar","[[I'm sorry, I didn't catch that.]] / [[Could you speak up, please?]]"],["Mengulang","[[Could you repeat that, please?]] / [[Could you say that again?]]"],["Mengeja","[[Could you spell that for me?]] / [[How do you spell your surname?]]"],["Memastikan","[[Let me read that back to you.]] / [[So that's 0812-3456, correct?]]"],["Bicara pelan","[[Could you speak a little more slowly?]]"],["Sinyal buruk","[[The line is breaking up.]] / [[I can't hear you very well.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Mengeja dan menyebut angka","table":[["Hal","Cara menyebut","Contoh"],["Huruf","[[A as in Apple, B as in Boy, C as in Cat ...]]","[[Putri: P as in Paul, U as in Umbrella, T, R, I]]"],["Nomor telepon","disebut satu per satu; 0 = *oh* atau *zero*","[[0812-3456 = oh-eight-one-two, three-four-five-six]]"],["Email","@ = *at*, . = *dot*, _ = *underscore*, - = *dash/hyphen*","[[dina.putri@abc.com = dina dot putri at abc dot com]]"],["Angka ganda","double / triple","[[double five = 55]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Meninggalkan voicemail","table":[["Bagian","Contoh"],["Salam dan identitas","[[Hello, this is Dina Putri from PT Maju Jaya.]]"],["Tujuan","[[I'm calling about the delivery on Friday.]]"],["Permintaan","[[Could you call me back at 0812-3456-7890?]]"],["Penutup","[[Thank you. Have a good day.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Menyambungkan telepon","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Good morning, PT Maju Jaya, Dina speaking. How can I help you?","id":"Selamat pagi, PT Maju Jaya, Dina di sini. Ada yang bisa saya bantu?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Good morning. Could I speak to Mr. Adi in Finance, please?","id":"Selamat pagi. Bisakah saya berbicara dengan Pak Adi dari Keuangan?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"May I ask who's calling?","id":"Boleh saya tahu siapa yang menelepon?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"This is Tom Wijaya from Sinar Supplies.","id":"Saya Tom Wijaya dari Sinar Supplies."},{"who":"Dina","en":"One moment, Mr. Wijaya. I'll put you through.","id":"Sebentar, Pak Wijaya. Saya sambungkan."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Mencatat pesan","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"I'm afraid Mr. Adi is in a meeting at the moment. Can I take a message?","id":"Maaf, Pak Adi sedang rapat saat ini. Boleh saya catat pesannya?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Yes, please. Could you ask him to call me back? My number is 0812-3456-7890.","id":"Ya, tolong. Bisakah Anda meminta beliau menelepon balik? Nomor saya 0812-3456-7890."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Let me read that back to you: oh-eight-one-two, three-four-five-six, seven-eight-nine-oh. Is that correct?","id":"Biar saya bacakan kembali: 0812-3456-7890. Apakah benar?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"That's correct. Thank you.","id":"Benar. Terima kasih."},{"who":"Dina","en":"You're welcome. I'll make sure he gets your message.","id":"Sama-sama. Saya pastikan beliau menerima pesan Anda."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 3: Voicemail","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Hello, this is Tom Wijaya from Sinar Supplies. I'm calling about the invoice for May. Could you please call me back at 0812-3456-7890? Thank you, and have a good day.","id":"Halo, saya Tom Wijaya dari Sinar Supplies. Saya menelepon tentang faktur bulan Mei. Bisakah Anda menelepon balik di 0812-3456-7890? Terima kasih, semoga hari Anda menyenangkan."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Tips berbicara di telepon","text":"Bicaralah **lebih pelan dan jelas**, tersenyum (suaramu terdengar lebih ramah), siapkan pena, dan **ulangi** nomor atau nama untuk memastikan. Akhiri dengan [[Thank you for calling.]]"},{"t":"summary","items":["Menjawab: [[... speaking. How can I help you?]]; menelepon: [[This is ... from ...]].","Menyambung: [[I'll put you through.]]; pesan: [[Can I take a message?]]","Klarifikasi: [[Could you repeat that?]] / [[Could you spell that?]] / [[Let me read that back.]]","Voicemail: **identitas → tujuan → permintaan → penutup**."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["voicemail","pesan suara"],["extension","nomor sambungan"],["call back","menelepon balik"],["hang up","menutup telepon"],["spell","mengeja"]],"exp":"Kosakata telepon.","k":"9c7a6079"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan situasi dengan ungkapan:","pairs":[["orang tidak ada","He's not in at the moment."],["menyambungkan","I'll put you through."],["tidak dengar","I didn't catch that."],["salah sambung","You have the wrong number."]],"exp":"Ungkapan telepon.","k":"a6412258"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan simbol dengan cara menyebutnya:","pairs":[["@","at"],[".","dot"],["_","underscore"],["-","dash"]],"exp":"Menyebut email.","k":"cc35acd0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan menjawab telepon kantor adalah...","options":["Good morning, PT Maju Jaya, Dina speaking. How can I help you?","Who are you?","What?","Yes?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan dan lengkap.","k":"94e7a857"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan menanyakan siapa penelepon adalah...","options":["May I ask who's calling?","Who are you?","What's your name, tell me.","You are who?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"719c9bfe"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk menyambungkan telepon adalah...","options":["I'll put you through.","I'll hang you up.","I'll cut you.","I'll stop you."],"answer":0,"exp":"put through.","k":"76fab2ae"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jika orang yang dicari tidak ada, kita menawarkan...","options":["Can I take a message?","Go away.","Call again.","Who cares?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Menawarkan pesan.","k":"19e79332"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk meminta pengulangan kita berkata...","options":["Could you repeat that, please?","What again?","Say it!","Repeat."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"d3e1b176"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara mengucapkan 0812 adalah...","options":["oh-eight-one-two","zero-eight-twelve","eight-hundred-twelve","oh-eighty-twelve"],"answer":0,"exp":"Angka disebut satu per satu.","k":"e7af6f8c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara mengucapkan 55 pada nomor telepon adalah...","options":["double five","fifty-five","five-fifty","triple five"],"answer":0,"exp":"double five.","k":"0bb326a0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"dina.putri@abc.com dibaca...","options":["dina dot putri at abc dot com","dina point putri a abc point com","dina dash putri at abc com","dina putri abc"],"answer":0,"exp":"dot dan at.","k":"99fa171f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian voicemail yang pertama adalah...","options":["menyebut nama dan perusahaan","mengucapkan selamat tinggal","meminta uang","menutup telepon"],"answer":0,"exp":"Identitas.","k":"3c68307e"},{